--------------------------------- EDGE CASES HANDLED ---------------------------------

1. Empty Stack Pop:
   - top[i] == -1 -> returns -1 ✓

2. Array Overflow:
   - When free_Top == -1, push would fail (not explicitly checked but constraints guarantee no overflow)

3. Single Element Stack:
   - Push then pop works correctly ✓

4. All Stacks Empty:
   - All top[i] = -1, all pops return -1 ✓

5. One Stack Uses All Space:
   - Works correctly, other stacks stay empty ✓

6. Alternating Push/Pop Across Stacks:
   - Free list management ensures correct slot reuse ✓


